  adapter layers, the adapter maps it to the domain (adapter/gateway-to-domain-mapper).
  Exemplars: captcha-gateway .../response/GatewayCaptchaResponse.java, e-health-gateway .../dto/GatewayTherapeuticExclusion.java
  Target: <capability>-gateway/src/main/java/<pkg>/Gateway<Name>.java
  Package: "package" is the full package of the file (no suffix is appended).
  Vars:   package, Name, imports[],
          fields[type, name, json (optional: the JSON property when it differs), last (true on the final field:
                 record components are comma-separated and mustache cannot see the end of a list)]
  Left to you: nested records.
}}
